[
  {
    "id": "3.1",
    "title": "Collection Mode",
    "capitulo": "The Collection",
    "text": [
      "The SBI buzzes at the base of your skull. Outside and inside at once.",
      "[KAEDA] \"There. From now on, every time you fight, we get paid.\"",
      "She hands you a fresh token. This one's hot.",
      "[KAEDA] \"It works like this: everybody watches the arena. Nobody watches the arena floor. And that's where the cable runs.\"",
      "You snap in the token. A new interface opens in the corner of the display, green, low-key, like a banking app nobody knows you have.",
      "[SISTEMA] \"ANOMALOUS CODE ACTIVE. COLLECTION MODE INITIALIZED.\"",
      "---",
      "It's been a week since you landed here. Feels like a year.",
      "{veia:1} You already read the system like a newspaper. Fast, suspicious, hunting for the story they left out.",
      "{veia:2} You already climbed forty thousand spots in the rankings. On PowWow, people call you \"the rookie who never drops.\" You pretend you didn't see it.",
      "{veia:3} The wall of your cube already has your own red-line map. Kaeda saw it and said nothing. Coming from her, that's a compliment.",
      "{veia:4} You already got people owing you favors in three different zones. None of them know your real name. Better that way.",
      "{veia:5} The static now speaks in short sentences. Never when you want it to. Always when you need it.",
      "---",
      "Kaeda crosses her arms.",
      "[KAEDA] \"Welcome to the real work.\""
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Start collecting",
        "flags_required": [
          "RECRUTADO"
        ],
        "flags_set": [
          "ATO3_INICIADO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.2_dia8"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.2_dia8",
    "title": "First Collection",
    "text": [
      "Day 8. You wake up in the Organization's cube and Kaeda's already at the terminal. You've never seen her sleep. Starting to suspect she doesn't.",
      "[KAEDA] \"Today's arena day. I need battle data to cross-reference with the system logs.\"",
      "[KAEDA] \"But the day's yours. Do what you think's best. Just don't come back to me empty-handed.\"",
      "She doesn't even look up from the screen.",
      "Freedom with strings attached. Like a job, just without the contract."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Fight in the Arena, the main collection",
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA8_ARENA"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.2-briga"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "label": "Dig through the public terminal logs",
        "requer": {
          "hab": 32
        },
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA8_INVESTIGACAO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.2_investiga"
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "label": "Build a broken file from the terminal",
        "isPuzzle": true,
        "puzzleType": "terminal",
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA8_PUZZLE"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.3_dia9"
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "label": "Run a hustle for the MDR to pay the bills",
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA8_TRABALHO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.2_trabalho"
      },
      {
        "id": "E",
        "label": "Sleep. Your body's begging",
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA8_DESCANSO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.2_descanso"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.2-briga",
    "title": "Pickup at the Arena",
    "luta": "GhostPulse",
    "text": [
      "You win by a hair. The pickup, by a mile.",
      "[SISTEMA] \"PICKUP: 1 FILE.\""
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Take the file to Kaeda",
        "next_scene": "3.3_dia9",
        "luta": 5
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.2_investiga",
    "title": "User 47",
    "text": [
      "You burn the morning at the public terminals, one after another, fronting like you're hunting for work.",
      "No you're not. You're reading what nobody reads: the access log. The list of who got in, when, and from where.",
      "And a pattern shows up. A user with Yohualticit employee credentials poking into player data after hours. Always in the dead of night. Always from the same terminal.",
      "One name keeps popping: ENG_INTEGRIDADE_47.",
      "You've never seen that name before. But the clearance is so high it makes your head spin.",
      "A message from Kaeda comes through before you can say a word:",
      "[KAEDA] \"I'm seeing what you're seeing. Nice work. That's a lead.\"",
      "She was watching you. Of course she was."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Call it a day",
        "flags_set": [
          "PISTA_TERMINAL"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.3_dia9"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.2_trabalho",
    "title": "Hustle",
    "text": [
      "You kill the SBI and step back into the real world for a day.",
      "MDR's still the same. Marelia still wants its cut. Power, water, rent on a three-by-three room, the corner store tab already got your name in the book.",
      "You run deliveries. Up hills, down stairs, hauling other people's crap for people who won't even look at you.",
      "By the end of the day, your legs are shaking and the DIX beeps. One twenty.",
      "It ain't much. Covers the power. Keeps the SBI on one more week.",
      "No leads today. But the collection keeps going tomorrow, and tomorrow you'll still have power to collect."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Sleep",
        "next_scene": "3.3_dia9"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.2_descanso",
    "title": "Pause",
    "text": [
      "You spend the day flat on your back in the cube, staring at the smooth ceiling.",
      "Kaeda doesn't complain. She knows detective work is a marathon, not a sprint. Run the first hundred meters at full speed, you'll finish the race crawling.",
      "Out there, your body thanks you. It's been days since it knew what rest was.",
      "And in the silence—no fight, no logs, no nothing—your brain does what it does best when you let it: it connects the dots on its own.",
      "More tomorrow."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Sleep for real",
        "next_scene": "3.3_dia9"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.3_dia9",
    "title": "Second Collection",
    "text": [
      "Day 9. The routine starts making sense—and that's the most dangerous thing. Routine means you stop paying attention.",
      "Kaeda's at the terminal, same spot as yesterday.",
      "[KAEDA] \"Yesterday's data confirmed it. Someone on the inside is messing with fight results.\"",
      "[KAEDA] \"Still not proof. Just a whiff. Today, try a different angle.\""
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Fight again, different cover.",
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA9_ARENA"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.3-briga"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "label": "Talk to the square regulars.",
        "requer": {
          "hab": 42
        },
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA9_INVESTIGACAO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.3_investiga"
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "label": "Decode an intercepted signal.",
        "isPuzzle": true,
        "puzzleType": "decoder",
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA9_PUZZLE"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.4_dia10"
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "label": "Open your own SBI and see what's inside.",
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA9_SBI"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.3_sbi"
      },
      {
        "id": "E",
        "label": "Run another hustle in the MDR.",
        "flags_set": [
          "DIA9_TRABALHO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.2_trabalho"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.3-briga",
    "title": "The Wall",
    "luta": "IronVeil",
    "text": [
      "He drops like a demolished building: slow, then all at once.",
      "The SBI vibrates twice. One more file. And an anomaly: the fight was reprogrammed three times before it started. By someone who wasn't you or him."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Take this to Kaeda",
        "next_scene": "3.4_dia10",
        "luta": 6
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.3_investiga",
    "title": "Square Talk",
    "text": [
      "You spend the day on the corners of Praça Central. You don't ask a thing. Asking gets you charged. You just hang close, lean in, offer a sip, laugh at the right joke.",
      "And people talk. They always do.",
      "A data dealer, after his third sip, lets it slip:",
      "[COMERCIANTE] \"You notice the mid-rank fights lately? Shit's all wrong. The guy who should win loses. The guy who should lose wins. Every single night.\"",
      "[COMERCIANTE] \"And the ones who bet on the underdog? Always the same bunch. Always.\"",
      "He laughs like it's just gossip.",
      "It ain't gossip. It's a betting scheme. And a scheme like that's got an owner.",
      "[KAEDA] \"That lines up with the logs. We're close.\""
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Pay for the round and slip out on the low",
        "flags_set": [
          "PISTA_NPC"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.4_dia10"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.3_sbi",
    "title": "Inside the SBI",
    "text": [
      "You spend hours with the SBI open, reading its own code like you're reading your own medical chart.",
      "The Organization's mod is elegant. It opens a parallel data tunnel during the fight, invisible to the system. Clean work.",
      "But there's something else in there.",
      "Under the mod, before it, older than it, there's another. A line no one from the Organization wrote. A line that came from the factory.",
      "Every SBI has it. Yours, Kaeda's, three billion people's.",
      "You close the SBI slowly.",
      "*This is bigger than some employee selling fight results.*",
      "Way bigger."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Tell Kaeda",
        "flags_set": [
          "PISTA_SBI"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.4_dia10"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.4_dia10",
    "title": "The Watcher",
    "text": [
      "Day 10. Kaeda greets you with a look you've never seen on her. Not exhaustion. That's anger, kept on a leash.",
      "[KAEDA] \"I got partial access to Yohualticit's internal logs.\"",
      "She spins the terminal your way.",
      "[KAEDA] \"User 47 is real. Employee. Title: Systems Integrity Engineer.\"",
      "[KAEDA] \"Real name, locked down by contract. But we got the title.\"",
      "Systems Integrity Engineer. The guy getting paid to sniff out fraud in the system.",
      "---",
      "The watcher's the thief.",
      "I've seen this happen on the street more times than I can count. The store security guard's the one walking out with the goods. The inspector's the one charging the toll. The one who watches the place knows every hole in the fence.",
      "{hab:13} And you're already seeing the path to his terminal. Narrow, watched, possible.",
      "{hab:33} And you already know where to look: not at his title. At his paycheck.",
      "{hab:53} In the corner of Kaeda's terminal screen, the static sketches a shape. It knows where 47 hides things."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Keep gathering proof slowly",
        "flags_set": [
          "PISTA_CARGO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.5_dia11"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "label": "Get into his terminal",
        "requer": {
          "hab": 13
        },
        "flags_set": [
          "TENTOU_HACKEAR"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.4_puzzle"
      },
      {
        "id": "C",
        "label": "Follow user 47's money",
        "requer": {
          "hab": 33
        },
        "flags_set": [
          "PISTA_CARGO",
          "SEGUIU_DINHEIRO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.4_puzzle_ok"
      },
      {
        "id": "D",
        "label": "Ask the static where he hides",
        "requer": {
          "hab": 53
        },
        "flags_set": [
          "PISTA_CARGO",
          "OUVIU_ECO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.4_puzzle_ok"
      },
      {
        "id": "E",
        "label": "Head back to the shelter and train",
        "someQuandoSabe": [
          13,
          23,
          33,
          43,
          53
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.treino"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.4_puzzle",
    "title": "Break-In",
    "text": [
      "Yohualticit corporate terminal's a glass box with a hundred cameras. You're outside, at night, hood up.",
      "Not literally. But that's the vibe.",
      "[SISTEMA] \"ACCESS DENIED. ATTEMPT LOGGED.\"",
      "First attempt's burned. You got one shot before the alarm screams your name to the whole building.",
      "There's a path through the cams. Tight. Shifting every second.",
      "You breathe. Back in the room, your real hand grips the sheet."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Slip between the cameras",
        "isPuzzle": true,
        "puzzleType": "stealth",
        "flags_set": [
          "PUZZLE_TERMINAL_OK"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.4_puzzle_ok",
        "next_falha": "3.4_puzzle_fail"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "label": "Abort before you're spotted",
        "flags_set": [
          "PUZZLE_TERMINAL_FAIL"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.4_puzzle_fail"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.4_puzzle_fail",
    "title": "Door's Locked",
    "text": [
      "No dice.",
      "You slip out of the terminal before the alarm, but you leave empty. The door's still shut, and now you know somebody messed with the handle.",
      "Kaeda doesn't even ask when you get back. She sees it on your face.",
      "[KAEDA] \"It's cool. We roll with what we got.\"",
      "She says it calm. But she stubs out her data cig harder than usual."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Crash and try to forget",
        "next_scene": "3.5_dia11"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.4_puzzle_ok",
    "title": "Inside",
    "destaque": true,
    "text": [
      "The system cracks.",
      "You're in. On the Integrity Engineer's personal terminal, where no player should ever be.",
      "His name's still locked. But you find something better than a name.",
      "A transfer record. Recurring payment, every week, to accounts that don't show up anywhere. And the dates line up, one by one, with the weird late-night fights.",
      "Money doesn't lie. People lie. Money just moves.",
      "You copy everything and bail three seconds before the alarm wakes.",
      "Three seconds. Out in the room, you realize you've been holding your breath the whole time."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Take the proof to the shelter",
        "flags_set": [
          "PISTA_FINANCEIRA"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.5_dia11"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.5_dia11",
    "title": "The Picture",
    "text": [
      "Day 11. With everything on the table, the whole picture finally comes together.",
      "User 47 logs into the system every night, between eleven at night and two in the morning.",
      "The weird fights always go down in the next two hours.",
      "And the money moves the day after.",
      "Every week. It's been months. Maybe years.",
      "Kaeda's hyped and tense at the same time, like a guitar string wound too tight.",
      "[KAEDA] \"We got the position, the schedule, and the pattern. Only thing missing is the face.\"",
      "[KAEDA] \"And I know how to get it.\""
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Spill.",
        "next_scene": "3.6_dia12"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.6_dia12",
    "title": "The Plan",
    "text": [
      "[KAEDA] \"We book you a fight for when he's messing with the system.\"",
      "[KAEDA] \"When he goes in to reprogram the fight, he'll be inside the arena with you. For a minute, maybe two. And your SBI can pull the signature of whoever's messing with it.\"",
      "She leans on the table.",
      "[KAEDA] \"It works, we get a name. It doesn't, he knows someone's investigating. And then we're the target.\"",
      "She doesn't soften it. Never does. It's the one thing about her you trust with your eyes closed."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "\"Book the fight.\"",
        "flags_set": [
          "PLANO_CAPTURA"
        ],
        "decisao": true,
        "next_scene": "3.6-briga"
      },
      {
        "id": "B",
        "label": "\"Give me a day to get ready.\"",
        "flags_set": [
          "PLANO_ADIADO"
        ],
        "next_scene": "3.7_preparacao"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.7_preparacao",
    "title": "Night Before",
    "text": [
      "You spend the day training. Kaeda spends the day tweaking the SBI.",
      "You rehearse the fight like you're rehearsing a heist. Where you stand. How long you hold. What you do if the arena loads wrong.",
      "[KAEDA] \"The tool works. Now it's on you to be standing when it counts.\"",
      "At night, you don't sleep. You stare at the cube ceiling and think about that three-by-three cell—miles away and already breathing down your neck.",
      "Next day, no more excuses."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Enter the arena",
        "flags_set": [
          "PLANO_CAPTURA"
        ],
        "decisao": true,
        "next_scene": "3.6-briga"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.6-briga",
    "title": "The Capture",
    "luta": "Digital Shadow",
    "text": [
      "[SISTEMA] \"CAPTURE IN PROGRESS... 40%... 80%...\"",
      "The shadow freezes mid-strike. Her fist stops two fingers from your face.",
      "[SISTEMA] \"100%.\""
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Disconnect",
        "next_scene": "3.8_captura_ok",
        "luta": 7
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.8_captura_ok",
    "title": "Signature",
    "destaque": true,
    "text": [
      "The arena vanishes. Your SBI vibrates so hard you feel it in your teeth.",
      "[SISTEMA] \"SIGNATURE CAPTURED. PROCESSING...\"",
      "The shelter terminal shows a name.",
      "And suddenly it all clicks. The Integrity Engineer isn't just some operator. He's someone with direct access to the ranking core. To the whole SDR. To the place where they decide who's somebody and who's nobody.",
      "Kaeda appears in front of you. Pale. For the first time you see her scared.",
      "[KAEDA] \"He knows we were there.\"",
      "[KAEDA] \"We've got seventy-two hours before he wipes all the evidence. And us along with it.\"",
      "In the corner of the display, a timer you never set starts counting down on its own."
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Start the count",
        "flags_set": [
          "FIM_ATO3"
        ],
        "next_scene": "4.1"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "3.treino",
    "title": "Training at the Shelter",
    "ensina": [
      12,
      22,
      32,
      42,
      52,
      13,
      23,
      33,
      43,
      53
    ],
    "text": [
      "You get back to the shelter. Kaeda doesn't even ask. Just clears the two chairs out of the way and boots up the old simulator she keeps under the mattress.",
      "[KAEDA] \"You don't break down a locked door. You learn to open it. Go.\"",
      "{veia:1} She hands you fake terminal after fake terminal, each one locked down tighter than the last, until your hand stops hunting for the edge and starts finding it.",
      "{veia:2} She gets on the simulator herself. Hits with no warning, no rhythm, hits until your body learns what your head's still stuck on.",
      "{veia:3} She dumps a pile of old Organization logs on the table and tells you to find what doesn't add up. First pile you find nothing. Fifth pile, you find it before she does.",
      "{veia:4} She pretends to be five different people, one at a time. Buying, selling, lying, threatening, begging. You miss four. Then three. Then none.",
      "{veia:5} She shuts everything down and sits next to you in the dark. \"I don't hear what you hear. But I know how to stay quiet.\" And in her silence, the static speaks clearer than ever.",
      "---",
      "When you finish, she's already back at the terminal, like nothing happened.",
      "[KAEDA] \"Now go back and open the door.\""
    ],
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "A",
        "label": "Back to the investigation",
        "next_scene": "3.4_dia10"
      }
    ]
  }
]
